Text: (2019), who predict the roles of the Russian trolls on Twit- ter by leveraging social theory and Actor-Network Theory approaches. They characterize trolls using the digital traces they leave behind, which is mod- eled using a time-sensitive semantic edit distance. For this purpose, they use the “IRA Russian Troll” dataset (Linvill and Warren, 2018), which we also use in our experiments.

