Text: In par- ticular, we focus on the case of the 2016 US Pres- idential Elections, for which a public dataset from Twitter is available. For this case, we consider only accounts that post content in English, and we wish to divide the trolls into some of the func- tional categories identiﬁed by Linvill and Warren (2018): left troll, right troll, and news feed.

